Route43_Text_CamperSpencerIntro::
	.string "I can do so much with my POKéMON--\n"
	.string "it’s super-fun!$"

Route43_Text_CamperSpencerDefeat::
	.string "Losing isn’t fun at all...$"

Route43_Text_CamperSpencer::
	.string "What is going on at LAKE OF RAGE?\p"
	.string "We were planning to camp there.$"

Route43_Text_Picnicker472Intro::
	.string "Are you going to LAKE OF RAGE too?\p"
	.string "Let’s play for a little while!$"

Route43_Text_Picnicker472Defeat::
	.string "I played too much!$"

Route43_Text_Picnicker472::
	.string "I’m having a picnic with POKéMON.\n"
	.string "Won’t you join us?$"

Route43_Text_Pokemaniac188Intro::
	.string "Hey! Do you have any rare POKéMON?$"

Route43_Text_Pokemaniac188Defeat::
	.string "Oh, my poor POKéMON! Darlings!$"

Route43_Text_Pokemaniac188::
	.string "I’d be happy just to own a single\n"
	.string "rare POKéMON.$"

Route43_Text_PokemaniacRonIntro::
	.string "Would you get this?\p"
	.string "Some {RIVAL} guy made fun of my\n"
	.string "POKéMON!\p"
	.string "Darn it! My POKéMON’s great!$"

Route43_Text_PokemaniacRonDefeat::
	.string "My NIDOKING did pretty right on!$"

Route43_Text_PokemaniacRon::
	.string "It’s okay for people to like\n"
	.string "different types of POKéMON.\p"
	.string "POKéMON isn’t just about having the\n"
	.string "most powerful one.$"

Route43_Text_PokemaniacBenIntro::
	.string "I love POKéMON!\p"
	.string "That’s why I started--and why\n"
	.string "I’ll keep on collecting POKéMON!$"

Route43_Text_PokemaniacBenDefeat::
	.string "How could you do this to me?$"

Route43_Text_PokemaniacBen::
	.string "What else do I like besides\n"
	.string "POKéMON?\p"
	.string "MARY on the radio.\n"
	.string "I bet she’s cute!$"

Route43_Text_FishermanMarvinIntro::
	.string "I’m in a slump.\p"
	.string "Maybe it’s the gear I’m using.\n"
	.string "Let’s battle for a change of pace!$"

Route43_Text_FishermanMarvinDefeat::
	.string "I lost, but I feel better anyway.$"

Route43_Text_FishermanMarvin::
	.string "KURT’s NET BALL is the best for\n"
	.string "catching WATER POKéMON.\p"
	.string "It’s much more effective than a\n"
	.string "ULTRA BALL.$"

Route43_Text_Trigger3_1::
	.string "I wonder where could that rare BUG\n"
	.string "POKéMON be hiding?\p"
	.string "My guide clearly says that a rare\n"
	.string "BUG POKéMON shows up sometimes\l"
	.string "on this route...$"

Route43_Text_Trigger3_2::
	.string "What?...\n"
	.string "YOU???\p"
	.string "What, have you to come to steal\n"
	.string "my precious rare BUG POKéMON?\l"
	.string "I won’t let you!\p"
	.string "Perhaps last time you cheated but\n"
	.string "this time there won’t be a cheat\l"
	.string "that saves you!\p"
	.string "Prepare to lose against my ultra\n"
	.string "tough BUG POKéMON!$"

Route43_Text_Trigger3Defeat::
	.string "Why? Why is this happening?$"

Route43_Text_Trigger3Victory::
	.string "YEAH! Finally you’ll understand!$"

Route43_Text_Trigger3_3::
	.string "Argh! When will you learn to stop\n"
	.string "cheating?\p"
	.string "There’s no way a BUG POKéMON\n"
	.string "could lose!\p"
	.string "That’s why I’m gonna find that\n"
	.string "rare BUG POKéMON and then I’ll\l"
	.string "defeat you for sure!$"

Route43_Text_Sign1::
	.string "ROUTE 43\n"
	.string "LAKE OF RAGE - MAHOGANY TOWN$"

Route43_Text_Sign3::
	.string "TRAINER TIPS\p"
	.string "All POKéMON have pros and cons\n"
	.string "depending on their types.\p"
	.string "If their types differ, a higher\n"
	.string "level POKéMON may lose in battle.\p"
	.string "Learn which types are strong and\n"
	.string "weak against your POKéMON’s type.$"
